<title>UK: UK's Bowthorpe buys U.S. testing firm Adtech.</title>
<headline>UK's Bowthorpe buys U.S. testing firm Adtech.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>British electronics group Bowthorpe Plc said on Monday it had agreed to buy U.S. maker of digital telecommunications test equipment company Adtech Inc for an initial $50.9 million in cash.</p>
<p>Bowthorpe said in a statement that a further $0.8 million was payable for covenants not to compete, with additional payment based on profit performance of up to $24.6 million due in early 2000.</p>
</text>
